; The Wild dragon's roost. Inherits scenes/regions/roost.tscn (Phase 35F), so all it carries is what
; makes it *this* roost: the floor knobs, the nest's identity, the occupant, and its own crags.
;
; 90 m of open ground. The clan hold's 60 m floor is sized for a town; this one has to hold a 45 m
; territory radius (ai.dragon) plus the run-up a player needs to get out of it, and it must not box
; in a creature that climbs to 12 m.
;
; The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild gave it a shape: an ice wall along the north, a splinter field in the east where the
; player enters, a five-metre narrows at x = 6, and the nest against the wall at (-14, -20) instead
; of at the exact centre. See the block above GlacierWallA. The scatter exclusion in
; data/regions/FrostfangReach.tres moved with the nest.
