; --- The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild: the north ice wall and the splinter field. The roost used to be four crags in a ring
; --- around a nest at the exact centre of a 90 m plate, which is the same shape as the other two
; --- roosts and reads identically from the ground. It is now a SHELF: a glacier wall along the north
; --- with one deliberate pass to the Ancient Aerie, dense tilted cover in the east where the player enters, a five-metre
; --- narrows at x = 6 between two ice masses, and open ground beyond it with the nest hard against
; --- the north wall at (-14, -20). Cover thins as you advance, so the fight pushes you forward.

